  (((agent "g2-m1")
    (kind note)
    (seq 149)
    (text
     "Design: parser-tools lexer (words, comma; keywords when/while/if/then/where/shall/the case-insensitive) + LALR grammar over token classes WORD/VERB/THE. The observable-verb requirement is in the grammar (lexer classifies observable verbs as VERB, weak modals as WEAK), so 'the code SHALL work' is a parse error with the verb list. Final period handled before parsing (better message). Error explanation derived from token context because yacc gives no expected-set.")
